        <a href={withBase('/redzone-sunday-sol-dubliners/')}>RedZone or one 19:00 game — that clock already ran</a>.
      </p>

      <OriginalFourBars lang="en" when="sunday" findHref="/visit/" />

      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <dl class="faq">
        <dt><strong>Atleti 21:00 is on. Leave or stay for 22:05 / 22:25?</strong></dt>
